<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσχω</span></b> , redupl. pres. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέχω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold</i> or <i>direct
				towards,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσχειν ὠκέας ἵππους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.465
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῶϊν</span> against us, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				350
			</span></i> ; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελάννα</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάος ἐπίσχει θάλασσαν ἐπ᾽ ἀλμύραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					25.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>restrain, keep in check,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπισχε μένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					446
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόδε γε</span> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δέος</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἐπίσχει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.45
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				932e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				45d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐπίσχον</span>”
				<i>obstruction,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cael.</u>
					311a9
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσχετε θυμὸν ἐνιπῆς καὶ χειρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.266
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ τοῦ θράσους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
					298a
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισχόμεναι ἑανῶν πτύχας</span>”
				<i>girding up,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					h.Cer.
					176
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσχετ᾽ ὀργῇ χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euphro
					8.3
				</span></i>
			 (dub.):—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be stopped,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσχεται τὸ τῆς κοιλίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Sud.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>leave off, stop, wait,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπισχε</span>”
				<i>hold!</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>El.</u>
					758
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>cease from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ γράφειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					257c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prm.</u>
				152b
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
